<title>SWEDEN: Kinnevik says sells U.S. SMA companies.</title>
<headline>Kinnevik says sells U.S. SMA companies.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish media company Industriforvaltnings AB Kinnevik said on Friday it was selling construction machinery distributors SMA Equipment Co Inc and SMA Stith Equipment Co.  </p>
<p>Kinnevik said in a statement the buyer was American Equipment co Inc, a subsidiary of Fluor Daniel Corporation.</p>
<p>Kinnevik said the purchase price was $38 million and meant a capital gain of $12.4 million for Kinnevik.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
